+    c. Store $\mathbf{n}$ and $d$ in the structure [S1, S2, unofficial].
 2.  **Signed Distance Query:**
-    Given a query point $\mathbf{q}$:
-    a. Compute the signed distance: $d_{signed} = \mathbf{n} \cdot \mathbf{q} + d$.
-    b. Return $d_{signed}$.
